  "description": "Synthetic electric pump with a pressure-balanced spool bypass governed by a massive hydraulic piston and preloaded return spring. Actual piston travel meters a passive turbulent port in the joint pressure/motion solve. Pressure feedback is mechanical; fill/drain valves still follow the explicit experiment schedule. Pump, motor, piston and spring energy plus viscous, restriction and clutch heat share the ledger. Parameters remain unverified; axial jet force, seal friction, cavitation, OEM maps and complete ECU/TCU are outside this research model. The prescribed rotational drive is 2 N*m; the later brake is 2 N*m, so the regulated-pressure clutch can capture within this three-second experiment.",
